# --- Stray / unexpanded-shell paths -----------------------------------------
# A literal top-level `~` can appear when a tilde fails to expand
# (e.g. `git add ~/path` typed without quotes, or a heredoc that didn't expand).
# Ignore it so it never gets committed again.
~
/*/~
*/*/~

# Backups / temp artifacts
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
